{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05679","headline":"登越州城 · 孙逖","name":"登越州城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越嶂绕层城，登临万象清。\n封圻沧海合，廛市碧湖明。\n晓日渔歌满，芳春櫂唱行。\n山风吹美箭，田雨润香秔。\n代阅英灵尽，人闲吏隐幷。\n赠言王逸少，已见曲池平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}